audioscout (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added man page audioscout(1) installed via dh_installdocs (closes lintian
    no-manual-page).
  * Fixed Maintainer e-mail domain and copyright license text (lintian
    bogus-mail-host, copyright-not-using-common-license-for-gpl).

  * Initial release: AudioScout - fast audio catalog listening and editing.
    Includes session restore, column settings persistence (config.json),
    waveform/spectrogram previews, markers, undo/redo and ffmpeg fallbacks.

  * Packaging: debhelper + CMake build with runtime dependencies on
    libsndfile1, libtag1v5, ffmpeg and alsa-utils (aplay playback helper).

 -- Alex Kurochkin <kurochkin.alex@gmail.com>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:30:00 +0000
